			"notes": "# Changes\n\n- Migrated the mod from the legacy Server Companion connection to the official Cosmic API.\n- Added the in-game API approval flow required for the mod to access approved features.\n- Updated HUD widgets, inventory overlays, entity markers, pings, and prompts to use API-backed data.\n- Updated the official mod credentials for the Cosmic API registry.\n\nWhen you first join after updating, approve the mod in-game when prompted so API-backed features can activate."
